  "result": "**What it does:** Order utilities — computes item totals, applies discount codes, averages item price, and formats an order receipt.\n\n**Bugs:**\n1. `calcTotal` (line 5): `i <= items.length` causes an off-by-one, reading `items[items.length]` (undefined) → `.price` throws `TypeError`. Should be `i < items.length`.\n2. `averageItemPrice` (line 20): divides by `items.length` with no check — `items.length === 0` gives `NaN`/`0/0` (and would also hit bug #1 first anyway).\n3. `applyDiscount`: no validation that `total` is a number or that `code` handling is case-sensitive (e.g., `\"save10\"` silently no-ops) — minor, likely intentional but worth flagging.",
